      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is injected into the **environment of the spawned child process** (the Ingest or Query agent), immediately before that process starts. The key is never held in the Hub\u0027s own process environment \u2014 instead, it is read from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injected directly into the child process\u0027s environment. This keeps the credential scoped only to the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API, rather than living in the Hub\u0027s process environment where it could potentially be leaked if the Hub were compromised.",
